Title: Bandar aur Magarmachh
Source: Panchatantra (chautha tantra, Labdhapranash)
Author: Accolade
Draft date: 23.11.2026

EXT. MIDDLE OF THE RIVER, THE CROCODILE'S HOME - EVENING

Magarmachh munh mein jaamun dabaaye ghar pahunchta hai.

PATNI (O.S.)
Aa gaye? Aaj mere liye kya laaye ho?

MAGARMACHH
(jaamun aage rakhte hue)
Mere dost bandar ne bheje hain. Woh kinaare ke jaamun ke ped par rehta hai.

Magarmachh ki patni jaamun khaati hai aur uski aankhen chamak uthti hain.

PATNI
(dheere se)
Jo bandar roz itne meethe phal khaata hai, uska dil kitna meetha hoga! Mujhe uska dil chaahiye.

MAGARMACHH
Woh mera dost hai!

PATNI
To dost ko ghar le aao. Nahin to main khaana-peena chhod doongi.

CUT TO:

EXT. MIDDLE OF THE RIVER - DAY

Bandar magarmachh ki peeth par baitha hai. Chaaron or gehra paani.

MAGARMACHH
Maaf karna dost. Meri patni ko tumhaara dil chaahiye.

BANDAR
(pal bhar chup rehkar, hanste hue)
Arre, pehle kyon nahin bataaya? Apna dil to main jaamun ke ped par hi chhod aaya hoon. Chalo, waapas chalkar le aate hain.

CUT TO:

EXT. RIVERBANK, JAMUN TREE - DAY

Magarmachh kinaare pahunchta hai. Bandar uchhalkar sabse oonchi daal par chadh jaata hai.

BANDAR
Moorkh! Dil bhi kabhi ped par rehta hai?

Bandar ek jaamun todkar paani mein phenkta hai.

BANDAR (CONT'D)
Jaao, yeh apni patni ko de dena. Aaj se hamaari dosti khatm.

KATHAVAACHAK (V.O.)
Sankat mein jo apni buddhi nahin khota, wahi bachta hai.

> FADE OUT.
